DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppbbmmttooxxbbmm  reads  a PBM image as input and produces an X10 or X11 bitmap
       as output.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common  Options  ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), ppbbmmttooxxbbmm recognizes the
       following command line options:



       --xx1100   This option causes ppbbmmttooxxbbmm to generate the X10 version of XBM.

              You may not specify this with --xx1111.

              This option was new with Netpbm 10.37 (December  2006).   Before
              that, use ppbbmmttooxx1100bbmm instead.


       --xx1111   This option causes ppbbmmttooxxbbmm to generate the X11 version of XBM.

              You may not specify this with --xx1100.

              The X11 version is the default, so this option has no effect.

              This option was new with Netpbm 10.37 (December 2006).




